<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>中川石材 業務管理</title>
  
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          colors: {
            brand: {
              50: '#f0f5fa',
              100: '#e0ebf5',
              500: '#2563eb',
              700: '#1d4ed8',
              800: '#1e3a8a',
              900: '#0f172a'
            },
            stone: {
              50: '#f8fafc',
              100: '#f1f5f9',
              600: '#475569',
              700: '#334155',
              800: '#1e293b'
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  </script>
  
  <!-- Chart.js CDN for 資金見通しグラフ -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
  
  <!-- Custom CSS -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 min-h-screen flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-blue-100">

  <!-- ============================================================== -->
  <!-- 共通ヘッダー -->
  <!-- ============================================================== -->
  <header class="bg-slate-900 text-white sticky top-0 z-30 shadow-md">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-3 sm:px-6 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between">
      
      <!-- ロゴ・店舗名 -->
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded bg-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-white shadow">
          石
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <h1 class="font-bold text-base sm:text-lg leading-tight tracking-wide">中川石材</h1>
            <span class="bg-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-medium border border-blue-400/40">試作版</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">経理・図面・請求・現場スケジュール管理</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 右側：ユーザー切り替えモック（権限制御体験） ＆ 本運用案内ボタン -->
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
        <!-- ユーザー切り替えプルダウン -->
        <div class="flex items-center bg-slate-800 rounded-lg p-1 border border-slate-700">
          <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 px-1 hidden md:inline">操作者:</span>
          <select id="userSelector" class="bg-slate-900 text-white text-xs font-medium rounded px-2 py-1.5 border border-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 cursor-pointer">
            <option value="wife">私（経理・図面・管理者）</option>
            <option value="husband">夫（現場・工事担当）</option>
            <option value="staff3">スタッフ3人目（閲覧限定）</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <!-- スマホ接続QRボタン -->
        <button id="btnOpenQrModal" class="hidden sm:flex items-center space-x-1 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-blue-300 border border-slate-700 text-xs px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg transition" title="スマホで開くためのQRコード">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v1m6 11h2m-6 0h-2v4m0-11v3m0 0h.01M12 12h4.01M16 20h4M4 12h4m12 0h.01M5 8h2a1 1 0 001-1V5a1 1 0 00-1-1H5a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 001 1zm12 0h2a1 1 0 001-1V5a1 1 0 00-1-1h-2a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 001 1zM5 20h2a1 1 0 001-1v-2a1 1 0 00-1-1H5a1 1 0 00-1 1v2a1 1 0 001 1z"></path></svg>
          <span class="font-medium">スマホで開く</span>
        </button>

        <!-- 本運用／設定ボタン -->
        <button id="btnOpenSettings" class="p-2 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg touch-target flex items-center justify-center transition" title="設定・本運用ガイド">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- 端末内保存の案内バナー -->
    <div class="bg-amber-500/20 border-t border-b border-amber-500/40 px-3 py-1 text-center text-xs text-amber-200 flex items-center justify-center space-x-1">
      <span>💡 この画面の変更は<strong>お使いの端末（ブラウザ）内に保存</strong>されます。ページを再読み込みしても消えません。</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ============================================================== -->
  <!-- メインレイアウト（PCサイドバー + メイン画面） -->
  <!-- ============================================================== -->
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full flex-1 flex flex-col md:flex-row pb-20 md:pb-8">

    <!-- PC専用サイドナビゲーション -->
    <aside class="hidden md:block w-64 p-4 border-r border-slate-200 bg-white min-h-[calc(100vh-100px)]">
      <div class="space-y-1">
        <button class="nav-tab-btn active w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold transition" data-view="home">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"></path></svg>
          <span>今日の対応</span>
          <span id="badgeOverdueSidebar" class="ml-auto bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold hidden">0</span>
        </button>

        <button id="sideNavFunds" class="nav-tab-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition" data-view="funds">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          <span>お金の管理</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-600 font-bold ml-auto bg-amber-50 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-amber-200">資金繰り</span>
        </button>

        <button class="nav-tab-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition" data-view="projects">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path></svg>
          <span>工事・お客様</span>
        </button>

        <button class="nav-tab-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition" data-view="logs">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          <span>作業履歴・弥生</span>
        </button>

        <button id="sideNavEmails" class="nav-tab-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition" data-view="emails">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
          <span>重要メール</span>
          <span id="badgeUnprocessedEmailsSidebar" class="ml-auto bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">2</span>
        </button>

        <button class="nav-tab-btn w-full flex items-center space-x-3 px-3 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 transition" data-view="settings">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          <span>本運用・設定</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- 既存ツール連携リンクエリア -->
      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-slate-200">
        <h4 class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">既存の仕組みとの連携</h4>
        <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center text-slate-600 hover:text-emerald-700 p-2 rounded hover:bg-emerald-50 transition border border-dashed border-slate-300">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mr-2"></span>
            <span>Mツール（スプレッドシート）</span>
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 ml-auto text-slate-400" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </a>
          <div class="p-2 bg-slate-50 rounded border border-slate-200 text-slate-500">
            <div class="font-medium text-slate-700">弥生会計 連携</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] mt-0.5">記帳進捗を作業履歴から記録中</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <!-- メインコンテンツ表示エリア -->
    <main class="flex-1 p-3 sm:p-6 overflow-x-hidden">
      
      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <!-- 1. ホーム / 今日の対応 VIEW -->
      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <section id="view-home" class="view-panel space-y-4">
        
        <!-- トップアラートカード（スマホでも目立つバッジ集計） -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-4">
          <!-- 期限超過 -->
          <div id="statCardOverdue" class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-red-100/70 transition shadow-sm" onclick="app.setTaskFilter('overdue')">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-red-700 flex items-center">
                <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-600 mr-1.5 animate-ping"></span>
                期限超過
              </span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-red-500 font-medium hidden sm:inline">早急に対応</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline">
              <span id="statCountOverdue" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-red-600">0</span>
              <span class="ml-1 text-xs text-red-600 font-medium">件</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 今日の期限 -->
          <div id="statCardToday" class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-amber-100/70 transition shadow-sm" onclick="app.setTaskFilter('today')">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-amber-800">今日期限</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-600 font-medium hidden sm:inline">今日中</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline">
              <span id="statCountToday" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-amber-700">0</span>
              <span class="ml-1 text-xs text-amber-700 font-medium">件</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 今週の予定 -->
          <div id="statCardWeek" class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 cursor-pointer hover:bg-blue-100/70 transition shadow-sm" onclick="app.setTaskFilter('week')">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-blue-800">今週の予定</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] text-blue-600 font-medium hidden sm:inline">近近日中</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline">
              <span id="statCountWeek" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-blue-700">0</span>
              <span class="ml-1 text-xs text-blue-700 font-medium">件</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- コントロールバー（フィルタ ＆ 追加ボタン） -->
        <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
          
          <!-- 状態・期限フィルタタブ -->
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 overflow-x-auto pb-1 sm:pb-0 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium">
            <button class="task-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg active bg-blue-600 text-white" data-filter="all">すべて</button>
            <button class="task-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100" data-filter="overdue">期限超過</button>
            <button class="task-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100" data-filter="today">今日中</button>
            <button class="task-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100" data-filter="week">今週中</button>
            <button class="task-filter-btn px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100" data-filter="completed">完了済み</button>
          </div>

          <!-- 担当者＆カテゴリ絞り込み -->
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
            <select id="taskAssigneeFilter" class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-xs rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500">
              <option value="all">担当: 全員</option>
              <option value="私">私（経理・図面）</option>
              <option value="夫">夫（現場・工事）</option>
            </select>

            <select id="taskCategoryFilter" class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 text-xs rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 text-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500">
              <option value="all">種別: すべて</option>
              <option value="支払い">支払い</option>
              <option value="返信">返信</option>
              <option value="工事準備">工事準備</option>
              <option value="経理作業">経理作業</option>
              <option value="その他">その他</option>
            </select>

            <!-- タスク追加ボタン（PC用） -->
            <button id="btnOpenAddTaskModal" class="hidden sm:flex items-center space-x-1.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow transition">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
              <span>対応を追加</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- タスク一覧表示コンテナ -->
        <div id="taskListContainer" class="space-y-2.5">
          <!-- JSで動的にレンダリングされます -->
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <!-- 2. お金の管理 VIEW -->
      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <section id="view-funds" class="view-panel hidden space-y-4">
        
        <!-- 権限なし警告（3人目スタッフ用） -->
        <div id="fundsRestrictedNotice" class="hidden bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-8 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m0 0v2m0-2h2m-2 0H10m4-11a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8V6zM5 10h14a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">閲覧権限がありません</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 max-w-md mx-auto">
            資金情報（口座残高・入出金予定・資金繰り）は、機密保護のため管理者（私・夫）のみ閲覧可能に制限されています。<br>
            上部の操作者切り替えから「私」または「夫」を選択すると確認できます。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="fundsContent" class="space-y-4">
          
          <!-- 利益と口座残高の混同防止 啓発メッセージ -->
          <div class="bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-600 p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-r-xl shadow-sm text-xs text-blue-900 flex items-start space-x-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
            <div>
              <span class="font-bold">利益（損益）と口座残高（手元資金）は異なります！</span>
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
                石材店では「契約・売上が上がっても、実際の入金は工事完了後」や「石材仕入れ代の先払い」が発生します。ここでは<strong>「何にいくら使っているか」と「支払日に口座のお金が足りるか（黒字倒産の防止）」</strong>を月次資金繰り表と費目別内訳から正確に把握できます。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- お金の管理 サブタブ（資金繰り表 / 支出内訳 / 工事別原価 / キャッシュフロー / 残高推移） -->
          <div class="bg-white p-1.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex items-center space-x-1 text-xs font-bold overflow-x-auto">
            <button class="funds-subtab-btn active px-3 sm:px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg bg-blue-600 text-white shadow-sm flex items-center space-x-1.5 whitespace-nowrap transition" data-subtab="statement">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 17v-2m3 2v-4m3 4v-6m2 10H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path></svg>
              <span>📑 月次 資金繰り表</span>
            </button>
            <button class="funds-subtab-btn px-3 sm:px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-1.5 whitespace-nowrap transition" data-subtab="breakdown">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 3.055A9.001 9.001 0 1020.945 13H11V3.055z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20.488 9H15V3.512A9.025 9.025 0 0120.488 9z"></path></svg>
              <span>📊 何に使っているか（支出分析）</span>
            </button>
            <button class="funds-subtab-btn px-3 sm:px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-1.5 whitespace-nowrap transition" data-subtab="profitability">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path></svg>
              <span>🏗️ 工事別 原価・利益（儲け）</span>
            </button>
            <button class="funds-subtab-btn px-3 sm:px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-1.5 whitespace-nowrap transition" data-subtab="cashflow">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
              <span>💵 キャッシュフロー・日繰り</span>
            </button>
            <button class="funds-subtab-btn px-3 sm:px-3.5 py-2 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 flex items-center space-x-1.5 whitespace-nowrap transition" data-subtab="overview">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 12l3-3 3 3 4-4M8 21l4-4 4 4M3 4h18M4 4h16v12a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V4z"></path></svg>
              <span>📈 残高推移・取引一覧</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <!-- サブ画面 1: 本格 月次資金繰り表（マトリクス） -->
          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <div id="subtab-panel-statement" class="funds-subpanel space-y-4">
            
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b pb-3 border-slate-100">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                    <span>📑 月次資金繰り予定・実績表</span>
                    <span class="ml-2 text-[10px] bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-semibold">石材店特化</span>
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">前月繰越・売上入金・原価仕入・人件費・固定費・借入返済の月別推移</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                  <button id="btnOpenAddTxModalStmt" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg shadow transition flex items-center space-x-1">
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
                    <span>入出金を登録</span>
                  </button>
                  <button onclick="window.print()" class="no-print bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 transition flex items-center space-x-1">
                    <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 17h2a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2h2m2 4h6a2 2 0 002-2v-4a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4a2 2 0 002 2zm8-12V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H9a2 2 0 00-2 2v4h10z"></path></svg>
                    <span>印刷</span>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- 資金繰り表テーブル（横スクロール対応） -->
              <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-slate-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
                <table id="cashFlowStatementTable" class="w-full text-xs text-left border-collapse min-w-[620px]">
                  <!-- JSで動的に構築 -->
                </table>
              </div>

              <!-- 表のセルクリック時の明細表示エリア -->
              <div id="stmtDetailContainer" class="hidden p-3 bg-blue-50/60 rounded-lg border border-blue-200 text-xs">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1.5 font-bold text-blue-900">
                  <span id="stmtDetailTitle">内訳明細</span>
                  <button id="btnCloseStmtDetail" class="text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-700 font-normal text-[11px]">閉じる ✕</button>
                </div>
                <div id="stmtDetailList" class="space-y-1 text-slate-700"></div>
              </div>

            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <!-- サブ画面 2: 何に使っているか（費目別支出分析） -->
          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <div id="subtab-panel-breakdown" class="funds-subpanel hidden space-y-4">
            
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b pb-3 border-slate-100">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                    <span>📊 費目別 支出構成分析（何にいくら使っているか）</span>
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">仕入・外注・人件費・燃料費・保険・借入返済などの割合と金額</p>
                </div>

                <!-- 集計対象月の選択 -->
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                  <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium">集計期間:</span>
                  <select id="expenseBreakdownMonthSelect" class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 text-slate-800 focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500">
                    <option value="all">今後3か月間（全期間）</option>
                    <option value="2026-10">2026年10月度</option>
                    <option value="2026-11">2026年11月度</option>
                    <option value="2026-12">2026年12月度</option>
                    <option value="2027-01">2027年01月度</option>
                  </select>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- 支出合計サマリーバナー -->
              <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white p-3.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between shadow-sm">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 font-medium" id="breakdownPeriodLabel">今後3か月間の支出総額</div>
                  <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black mt-0.5" id="breakdownTotalAmount">¥0</div>
                </div>
                <div class="text-right text-xs text-slate-300 space-y-0.5">
                  <div>石材仕入・工事費・給与・固定費</div>
                  <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">※不要な経費や資金繰りの圧迫要因をチェックできます</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- 固定費 vs 変動費（工事原価）サマリーカード -->
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-1">
                <div class="p-3 bg-amber-50/70 rounded-xl border border-amber-200">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1">
                    <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 flex items-center">
                      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mr-1.5"></span>固定費（維持管理・給与・返済）
                    </span>
                    <span id="fixedExpensePct" class="font-extrabold text-amber-800">0%</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-xl font-extrabold text-amber-950" id="fixedExpenseAmount">¥0</div>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-amber-700 mt-0.5">※専従者給与、公庫返済、保険、燃料代など（売上ゼロでも必要）</p>
                </div>

                <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50/70 rounded-xl border border-blue-200">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1">
                    <span class="font-bold text-blue-900 flex items-center">
                      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-blue-500 mr-1.5"></span>変動費（工事原価・仕入）
                    </span>
                    <span id="variableExpensePct" class="font-extrabold text-blue-800">0%</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="text-xl font-extrabold text-blue-950" id="variableExpenseAmount">¥0</div>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-blue-700 mt-0.5">※石材仕入代、生コン建材、重機リース、外注加工など</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- グラフ ＆ 費目別内訳リスト -->
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 items-center pt-2">
                <!-- ドーナツチャート -->
                <div class="h-64 relative flex items-center justify-center p-2 bg-slate-50/50 rounded-xl border border-slate-100">
                  <canvas id="expenseDonutChart"></canvas>
                </div>

                <!-- 費目ランキングリスト -->
                <div id="expenseRankingList" class="space-y-2 max-h-80 overflow-y-auto pr-1">
                  <!-- JSで動的に構築 -->
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <!-- サブ画面 3: 🏗️ 工事・案件別 原価・収支（個別原価管理） -->
          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <div id="subtab-panel-profitability" class="funds-subpanel hidden space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
              <div class="border-b pb-3 border-slate-100">
                <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                  <span>🏗️ 工事・案件別 原価収支＆粗利率</span>
                  <span class="ml-2 text-[10px] bg-indigo-100 text-indigo-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-semibold">個別原価計算</span>
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">「どの工事で石材代や重機にいくら使って、いくら儲かったのか」を工事ごとに可視化</p>
              </div>

              <!-- 工事別カード一覧 -->
              <div id="projectProfitabilityList" class="space-y-3">
                <!-- JSで動的に構築 -->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <!-- サブ画面 4: 💵 キャッシュフロー計算書 ＆ 日繰りカレンダー -->
          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <div id="subtab-panel-cashflow" class="funds-subpanel hidden space-y-4">
            
            <!-- キャッシュフローサマリー -->
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b pb-3 border-slate-100">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                    <span>💵 キャッシュフロー計算書（営業CF・財務CF）</span>
                  </h3>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">本業の現金創出力と借入返済の安全度を分析</p>
                </div>
                <!-- 期間選択 -->
                <select id="cashflowPeriodSelect" class="bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1.5 text-slate-800 focus:outline-none">
                  <option value="all">今後3か月間（全期間）</option>
                  <option value="2026-10">2026年10月度</option>
                  <option value="2026-11">2026年11月度</option>
                  <option value="2026-12">2026年12月度</option>
                  <option value="2027-01">2027年01月度</option>
                </select>
              </div>

              <!-- 3区分サマリーカード -->
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                <div class="p-3 bg-emerald-50 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200">
                  <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-800">Ⅰ. 営業活動によるCF (本業の儲け)</div>
                  <div class="text-xl font-black text-emerald-900 mt-1" id="cfOperatingVal">¥0</div>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-emerald-700 mt-0.5">売上入金 − (仕入・外注・給与・経費)</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-3 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                  <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-purple-800">Ⅱ. 財務活動によるCF (借入・返済)</div>
                  <div class="text-xl font-black text-purple-900 mt-1" id="cfFinancingVal">¥0</div>
                  <p class="text-[10px] text-purple-700 mt-0.5">借入金元金の定期返済</p>
                </div>
                <div class="p-3 bg-blue-900 text-white rounded-xl shadow-sm">
                  <div class="text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-200">Ⅲ. フリーキャッシュフロー (純増減)</div>
                  <div class="text-xl font-black mt-1 text-white" id="cfNetVal">¥0</div>
                  <div class="text-[10px] text-blue-200 mt-0.5" id="cfSafetyBadge">✅ 本業CFで借入返済を賄えています</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 日繰り表（日別・支払集中日カレンダー） -->
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3 border-slate-100">
                <div>
                  <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 flex items-center">
                    <span>📅 日繰り表（日別 支払集中日カレンダー）</span>
                  </h4>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-0.5">給料日(25日)・公庫返済(27日)・仕入振込(月末)などの集中日と残高推移</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="overflow-x-auto border border-slate-200 rounded-lg shadow-sm">
                <table class="w-full text-xs text-left min-w-[500px]">
                  <thead class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 font-bold uppercase text-[10px] border-b">
                    <tr>
                      <th class="py-2 px-3">日付</th>
                      <th class="py-2 px-2">特徴</th>
                      <th class="py-2 px-3 text-right">入金額</th>
                      <th class="py-2 px-3 text-right">出金額</th>
                      <th class="py-2 px-3 text-right">その日の収支</th>
                      <th class="py-2 px-3 text-right">予測預金残高</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody id="dailyCashFlowTableBody" class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                    <!-- JSで動的に構築 -->
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <!-- サブ画面 3: 従来の残高推移・未入金・明細（既存ビュー） -->
          <!-- ======================================================== -->
          <div id="subtab-panel-overview" class="funds-subpanel hidden space-y-4">

            <!-- 基準日残高カード ＆ 3か月後見通しカード -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
              
              <!-- 基準日残高（手入力カード） -->
              <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm relative">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-500 mb-1">
                  <span class="font-semibold text-slate-700 flex items-center">
                    <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mr-1.5"></span>
                    基準日の口座残高（手入力）
                  </span>
                  <button id="btnEditBankBalance" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 font-medium underline text-xs">変更</button>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-2">
                  <div class="text-xs text-slate-400" id="bankBaseDateDisplay">基準日: 2026/10/31</div>
                  <div id="bankBaseBalanceDisplay" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-800 tracking-tight mt-0.5">¥4,850,000</div>
                  <div id="bankNameDisplay" class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1 truncate">みずほ銀行 石材町支店</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- 今後3か月の入出金予定集計 -->
              <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 mb-1">基準日以降の入出金予定</div>
                <div class="space-y-1.5 mt-1 text-xs">
                  <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-emerald-700">
                    <span class="flex items-center">
                      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded bg-emerald-500 mr-1.5"></span>入金予定計（未入金）:
                    </span>
                    <span id="summaryUnreceived" class="font-bold">+¥2,955,000</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between items-center text-rose-700">
                    <span class="flex items-center">
                      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded bg-rose-500 mr-1.5"></span>支払予定計（未払い）:
                    </span>
                    <span id="summaryUnpaid" class="font-bold">-¥2,645,000</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex justify-between items-center pt-1 border-t border-slate-100 text-slate-600 font-medium">
                    <span>予定収支差額:</span>
                    <span id="summaryNetChange" class="font-bold text-slate-800">+¥310,000</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- 3か月後 予測着地残高 ＆ 最低残高警告 -->
              <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 to-blue-950 text-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div>
                  <div class="text-xs text-slate-300 font-medium flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span>今後3か月の予測残高</span>
                    <span class="bg-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 text-[10px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded">シミュレーション</span>
                  </div>
                  <div id="projectedFinalBalance" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black mt-2 text-white">¥5,160,000</div>
                </div>
                <div id="minBalanceAlert" class="mt-2 pt-2 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-[11px] text-emerald-300 flex items-center">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 mr-1 text-emerald-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
                  <span>期間中、最低残高も¥3,800,000以上をキープ見込み</span>
                </div>
              </div>

            </div>

            <!-- 残高推移グラフ ＆ 月別サマリー -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
              <!-- グラフ（左2列） -->
              <div class="lg:col-span-2 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                  <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center">
                    <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mr-1.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 12l3-3 3 3 4-4M8 21l4-4 4 4M3 4h18M4 4h16v12a1 1 0 01-1 1H5a1 1 0 01-1-1V4z"></path></svg>
                    今後3か月の預金残高推移予測
                  </h3>
                  <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">※二重計上防止：基準日以降のみ集計</span>
                </div>
                <div class="h-48 sm:h-56 relative">
                  <canvas id="cashFlowChart"></canvas>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- 月別見通し表（右1列） -->
              <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between">
                <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">月別の入出金見通し</h3>
                <div id="monthlySummaryContainer" class="space-y-2 text-xs">
                  <!-- JSでレンダリング -->
                </div>
                <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 pt-2 border-t border-slate-100">
                  ※予定が実績（振込済等）に切り替わると、即座に再計算されます。
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 未入金・未払い クイック確認カード -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <!-- 未入金一覧（回収予定） -->
              <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
                  <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-emerald-800 flex items-center">
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 mr-1.5"></span>
                    未入金（入金待ちの売上）
                  </h4>
                  <span id="unreceivedCountBadge" class="text-xs bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">0件</span>
                </div>
                <div id="unreceivedList" class="divide-y divide-slate-100 max-h-60 overflow-y-auto">
                  <!-- JSレンダリング -->
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- 未払い一覧（支払予定） -->
              <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2 border-b border-slate-100">
                  <h4 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-rose-800 flex items-center">
                    <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500 mr-1.5"></span>
                    未払い（支払期日の控えているもの）
                  </h4>
                  <span id="unpaidCountBadge" class="text-xs bg-rose-100 text-rose-800 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full font-bold">0件</span>
                </div>
                <div id="unpaidList" class="divide-y divide-slate-100 max-h-60 overflow-y-auto">
                  <!-- JSレンダリング -->
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 全入出金一覧 ＆ 新規登録 -->
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">入出金予定・実績一覧</h3>
                  <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">日付順の予定表。「予定／実績」ボタンでワンタップ切替可能です。</p>
                </div>
                <button id="btnOpenAddTxModal" class="flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow transition">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
                  <span>入出金予定を登録</span>
                </button>
              </div>
              
              <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                <table class="w-full text-left text-xs text-slate-600">
                  <thead class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-500 uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider border-b border-slate-200">
                    <tr>
                      <th class="py-2.5 px-3">日付</th>
                      <th class="py-2.5 px-2">区分</th>
                      <th class="py-2.5 px-3">相手先 / 内容</th>
                      <th class="py-2.5 px-3 text-right">金額</th>
                      <th class="py-2.5 px-3 text-center">予定/実績</th>
                      <th class="py-2.5 px-2 text-right">操作</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody id="txTableBody" class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
                    <!-- JSレンダリング -->
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <!-- 3. 工事・お客様の管理 VIEW -->
      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <section id="view-projects" class="view-panel hidden space-y-4">
        
        <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-sm sm:text-base font-bold text-slate-800">工事・お客様 案件一覧</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">墓所新設・改修・戒名彫刻の進捗、Google Driveリンク、関連タスクの管理</p>
          </div>
          <button id="btnOpenAddProjectModal" class="flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-3 py-2 rounded-lg shadow transition">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
            <span>新規案件を登録</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- 案件カード一覧 -->
        <div id="projectsListContainer" class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <!-- JSレンダリング -->
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <!-- 4. 作業履歴・弥生記録 VIEW -->
      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <section id="view-logs" class="view-panel hidden space-y-4">
        
        <!-- クイック記録バー（現場・スマホ向けワンタップ記録） -->
        <div class="bg-white p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500 mr-2"></span>
              現場・事務所のクイック作業記録
            </h3>
            <span class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">ワンタップで日時＆担当者を記録</span>
          </div>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-xs">
            <!-- 弥生会計専用ボタン -->
            <button id="btnOpenYayoiModal" class="bg-amber-50 hover:bg-amber-100 text-amber-900 border border-amber-300 font-bold p-2.5 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition">
              <span>📊 弥生の進捗記録</span>
            </button>
            <button class="quick-log-btn bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 p-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition" data-action="振込完了" data-category="振込・支払い">
              <span>💳 振込手続き完了</span>
            </button>
            <button class="quick-log-btn bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 p-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition" data-action="電話・メール返信完了" data-category="返信">
              <span>📞 お客様へ返信済</span>
            </button>
            <button class="quick-log-btn bg-slate-50 hover:bg-slate-100 text-slate-700 border border-slate-200 p-2.5 rounded-lg font-medium transition" data-action="現地調査・寸法確認" data-category="現場調査">
              <span>📐 現地寸法測定完了</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 音声入力対応 手動メモ追加フォーム -->
        <div class="bg-white p-3 sm:p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700">作業メモ・日報の追加</h4>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-1 text-slate-400 text-xs">
              <span>🎤 スマホ音声入力対応</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <form id="formAddActivityLog" class="space-y-2">
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <input type="text" id="logActionInput" placeholder="何をしたか（例: 佐藤様へ文字校正FAX送付、骨壺サイズ確認など）" required class="flex-1 text-xs border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
              
              <!-- 音声入力トグルボタン -->
              <button type="button" id="btnVoiceInput" class="bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-semibold flex items-center space-x-1 transition" title="音声認識で入力">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-red-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11a7 7 0 01-7 7m0 0a7 7 0 01-7-7m7 7v4m0 0H8m4 0h4m-4-8a3 3 0 01-3-3V5a3 3 0 116 0v6a3 3 0 01-3 3z"></path></svg>
                <span id="voiceStatusText" class="hidden sm:inline">音声入力</span>
              </button>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2">
              <textarea id="logDetailsInput" rows="2" placeholder="詳細メモ（必要に応じて寸法、連絡事項、次回やることを記載）" class="flex-1 text-xs border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none"></textarea>
              <div class="flex sm:flex-col justify-end gap-2">
                <select id="logCategoryInput" class="text-xs border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-2 py-1.5 bg-white text-slate-700">
                  <option value="一般作業">一般作業</option>
                  <option value="経理・弥生">経理・弥生</option>
                  <option value="図面・見積">図面・見積</option>
                  <option value="現場・工事">現場・工事</option>
                  <option value="お客様対応">お客様対応</option>
                </select>
                <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-xs font-bold px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition whitespace-nowrap">
                  記録する
                </button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <!-- 履歴一覧 ＆ 検索バー -->
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">時系列 作業タイムライン</h3>
            <!-- 検索入力 -->
            <div class="relative w-full sm:w-64">
              <input type="text" id="logSearchInput" placeholder="キーワード・担当・弥生で検索..." class="w-full text-xs pl-8 pr-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500">
              <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 absolute left-2.5 top-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="activityLogsList" class="space-y-3 relative before:absolute before:inset-0 before:left-3 sm:before:left-4 before:w-0.5 before:bg-slate-200">
            <!-- JSレンダリング -->
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <!-- 5. 重要メール VIEW -->
      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <section id="view-emails" class="view-panel hidden space-y-4">
        
        <!-- 権限なし警告（3人目スタッフ用） -->
        <div id="emailsRestrictedNotice" class="hidden bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-8 text-center">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-red-100 text-red-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m0 0v2m0-2h2m-2 0H10m4-11a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8V6zM5 10h14a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">重要メールの閲覧権限がありません</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1 max-w-md mx-auto">
            取引先・寺院・お客様との重要メールは、初期状態では3人目のスタッフには共有されない設計となっています。
          </p>
        </div>

        <div id="emailsContent" class="space-y-4">
          
          <div class="bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 text-xs text-sky-900 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 shadow-sm">
            <div class="flex items-start space-x-2">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
              <div>
                <span class="font-bold">「既読」と「対応済み」を独立管理！メールからタスク登録できます</span>
                <p class="text-sky-800 text-[11px] mt-0.5">
                  メールを読んだだけで返信や手配を忘れる漏れを防ぎます。ボタン1つで「今日の対応（ToDo）」に引き継げます。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="text-[10px] bg-white text-sky-800 border border-sky-300 font-semibold px-2 py-1 rounded whitespace-nowrap">
              試作：架空メール受信箱
            </span>
          </div>

          <!-- メールリスト -->
          <div id="emailsListContainer" class="space-y-3">
            <!-- JSレンダリング -->
          </div>

        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <!-- 6. 本運用・設定 VIEW -->
      <!-- ============================================================ -->
      <section id="view-settings" class="view-panel hidden space-y-4">
        
        <!-- 本運用への移行ガイド -->
        <div class="bg-white p-4 sm:p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-4">
          <div class="border-b border-slate-200 pb-3">
            <h2 class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">試作版と本運用（複数端末共有・権限制御）の違い</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-1">実データ移行・有料サービス契約・外部公開をスムーズに行うための提案仕様</p>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs leading-relaxed">
            
            <!-- 試作版の仕組み -->
            <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
              <span class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center mb-1">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-400 mr-2"></span>
                現在の試作版（端末内保存 / LocalStorage）
              </span>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-1 text-[11px]">
                <li>データはお使いのスマホ・PCのブラウザ内部にのみ保存されます。</li>
                <li>外部通信・サーバー契約・課金は一切発生しません。</li>
                <li>「夫のスマホで入力した内容が私のPCに即時反映される」共有はまだ行われません。</li>
                <li>権限制御は画面切り替えの体験用モックです。</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- 本運用の仕組み -->
            <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg border border-blue-200">
              <span class="font-bold text-blue-900 flex items-center mb-1">
                <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600 mr-2"></span>
                本運用で目指す姿（クラウド安全同期 / RLS）
              </span>
              <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-blue-800 space-y-1 text-[11px]">
                <li>安全なクラウドDB（Supabase等）で複数端末がリアルタイム同期。</li>
                <li>個別ログイン（私・夫・3人目）と多要素認証。</li>
                <li><strong>厳格な権限制御（RLS: 行レベルセキュリティ）</strong>により、3人目の端末には画面隠しだけでなく、通信データ自体が届かない完全な情報隔離。</li>
                <li>自動バックアップと暗号化通信。</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- データ管理（リセット・エクスポート・インポート） -->
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2">試作データの管理</h3>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs">
              <button id="btnExportData" class="bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 flex items-center space-x-1.5 transition">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4"></path></svg>
                <span>データ保存（JSON書出）</span>
              </button>
              
              <label class="bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 font-semibold px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 flex items-center space-x-1.5 cursor-pointer transition">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-8l-4-4m0 0L8 8m4-4v12"></path></svg>
                <span>データ復元（JSON読込）</span>
                <input type="file" id="importFileInput" accept=".json" class="hidden">
              </label>

              <button id="btnResetData" class="bg-red-50 hover:bg-red-100 text-red-700 font-semibold px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-red-200 flex items-center space-x-1.5 ml-auto transition">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 7l-.867 12.142A2 2 0 0116.138 21H7.862a2 2 0 01-1.995-1.858L5 7m5 4v6m4-6v6m1-10V4a1 1 0 00-1-1h-4a1 1 0 00-1 1v3M4 7h16"></path></svg>
                <span>初期サンプルデータに戻す</span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

    </main>

  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================== -->
  <!-- モバイル専用 下部固定ボトムナビゲーション -->
  <!-- ============================================================== -->
  <nav class="md:hidden fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-white border-t border-slate-200 z-40 shadow-lg bottom-nav">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-5 h-14">
      
      <button class="nav-tab-btn active flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-blue-600 relative touch-target" data-view="home">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6"></path></svg>
        <span class="text-[10px] mt-0.5 font-bold">今日</span>
        <span id="badgeOverdueMobile" class="absolute top-1 right-3 bg-red-600 text-white text-[9px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold hidden">0</span>
      </button>

      <button id="bottomNavFunds" class="nav-tab-btn flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 touch-target" data-view="funds">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        <span class="text-[10px] mt-0.5 font-medium">お金</span>
      </button>

      <button class="nav-tab-btn flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 touch-target" data-view="projects">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-indigo-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path></svg>
        <span class="text-[10px] mt-0.5 font-medium">工事</span>
      </button>

      <button class="nav-tab-btn flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 touch-target" data-view="logs">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        <span class="text-[10px] mt-0.5 font-medium">履歴</span>
      </button>

      <button id="bottomNavEmails" class="nav-tab-btn flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-slate-500 hover:text-slate-800 relative touch-target" data-view="emails">
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-sky-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
        <span class="text-[10px] mt-0.5 font-medium">メール</span>
        <span id="badgeUnprocessedEmailsMobile" class="absolute top-1 right-3 bg-amber-500 text-white text-[9px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold">2</span>
      </button>

    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- モバイル用 クイックタスク追加 Floating Action Button (FAB) -->
  <button id="btnMobileFabAddTask" class="sm:hidden fixed bottom-20 right-4 z-40 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white w-13 h-13 rounded-full shadow-lg flex items-center justify-center touch-target p-3">
    <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 4v16m8-8H4"></path></svg>
  </button>

  <!-- ============================================================== -->
  <!-- モーダル集 -->
  <!-- ============================================================== -->

  <!-- 1. タスク追加・編集モーダル -->
  <div id="modalTask" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 modal-backdrop">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3">
        <h3 id="modalTaskTitle" class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">今日の対応・タスク追加</h3>
        <button class="modal-close-btn text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <form id="formTask" class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <input type="hidden" id="taskEditId">

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">対応内容・仕事名 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="taskInputTitle" required placeholder="例: 東日本石材へ石材代金の振込、佐藤様へ戒名文字確認の電話など" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2.5 text-xs focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none">
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">種別（カテゴリ）</label>
            <select id="taskInputCategory" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs bg-white">
              <option value="支払い">支払い（振込・仕入等）</option>
              <option value="返信">返信（電話・メール・LINE）</option>
              <option value="工事準備">工事準備（生コン・道具・届出）</option>
              <option value="経理作業">経理作業（弥生・請求書発行等）</option>
              <option value="その他">その他</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">担当者</label>
            <select id="taskInputAssignee" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs bg-white">
              <option value="私">私（経理・図面）</option>
              <option value="夫">夫（現場・工事）</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">対応期限 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
            <input type="date" id="taskInputDueDate" required class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">関連する工事・案件</label>
            <select id="taskInputProject" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs bg-white">
              <option value="">なし（単独作業）</option>
              <!-- JSで動的に追加 -->
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">次にすること（作業メモ）</label>
          <textarea id="taskInputNextAction" rows="2" placeholder="具体的に何をするか（例: ネットバンキングを開いて送金、領収書PDFを保存）" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 focus:outline-none"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex justify-end space-x-2 border-t">
          <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition">キャンセル</button>
          <button type="submit" class="px-5 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold rounded-lg shadow transition">保存する</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 2. 口座残高＆基準日 変更モーダル -->
  <div id="modalBank" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 modal-backdrop">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3">
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">口座残高・基準日の手入力</h3>
        <button class="modal-close-btn text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <form id="formBank" class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">基準日（通帳やネット銀行を確認した日）</label>
          <input type="date" id="bankInputBaseDate" required class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2.5 text-xs focus:outline-none">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">その日時点の口座残高（円）</label>
          <div class="relative">
            <span class="absolute left-3 top-2.5 text-slate-400 font-bold">¥</span>
            <input type="number" id="bankInputBaseBalance" required min="0" step="1" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg pl-7 pr-3 py-2 text-sm font-bold focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500">
          </div>
          <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-1">※この基準日より後の入出金のみをシミュレーションに加算します（過去分の二重計上を防ぎます）。</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">銀行・口座メモ</label>
          <input type="text" id="bankInputBankName" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex justify-end space-x-2 border-t">
          <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition">キャンセル</button>
          <button type="submit" class="px-5 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold rounded-lg shadow transition">残高を更新</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 3. 入出金予定・実績 登録モーダル -->
  <div id="modalTx" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 modal-backdrop">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3">
        <h3 id="modalTxTitle" class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">入金・支払予定の登録</h3>
        <button class="modal-close-btn text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <form id="formTx" class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <input type="hidden" id="txEditId">

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">区分（入金 / 支払）</label>
            <select id="txInputType" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs font-bold bg-white">
              <option value="expense">支払（石材仕入・給与・外注など）</option>
              <option value="income">入金（工事着工金・完工代金など）</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">予定日 / 支払日 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
            <input type="date" id="txInputDate" required class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">相手先（業者名・お客様名・寺院名） <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="txInputPartner" required placeholder="例: 東日本石材、佐藤正雄様、中川建材など" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2.5 text-xs focus:outline-none">
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">金額（円） <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
            <div class="relative">
              <span class="absolute left-3 top-2 text-slate-400 font-bold">¥</span>
              <input type="number" id="txInputAmount" required min="1" step="1" placeholder="500000" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg pl-7 pr-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-bold focus:outline-none">
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">勘定科目・費目 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
            <select id="txInputCategory" required class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs bg-white focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-blue-500 font-medium">
              <!-- JSで動的に設定 -->
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">関連案件</label>
            <select id="txInputProject" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs bg-white">
              <option value="">なし（共通経費・単発）</option>
            </select>
          </div>

          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">状態（予定 / 実績）</label>
            <select id="txInputIsActual" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs bg-white font-medium">
              <option value="false">予定（未入金 / 未払い）</option>
              <option value="true">実績（振込済 / 入金確認済）</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">備考・詳細</label>
          <input type="text" id="txInputNote" placeholder="メモがあれば記入" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex justify-end space-x-2 border-t">
          <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition">キャンセル</button>
          <button type="submit" class="px-5 py-2 bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold rounded-lg shadow transition">保存する</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 4. 工事・お客様案件 追加・編集モーダル -->
  <div id="modalProject" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 modal-backdrop">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3">
        <h3 id="modalProjectTitle" class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">工事・お客様案件の登録</h3>
        <button class="modal-close-btn text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <form id="formProject" class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <input type="hidden" id="projEditId">

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">案件名 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="projInputName" required placeholder="例: 佐藤家 墓所新規建立工事（洋型・黒御影）" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2.5 text-xs focus:outline-none">
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">お客様・施主名</label>
            <input type="text" id="projInputCustomer" placeholder="例: 佐藤 正雄 様" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">墓所・現場場所</label>
            <input type="text" id="projInputLocation" placeholder="例: 青山霊園 2区3号" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">工事予定日・工期</label>
            <input type="text" id="projInputSchedule" placeholder="例: 2026-11-05 〜 12-10" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">担当者</label>
            <input type="text" id="projInputAssignee" placeholder="例: 夫（現場）・私（図面）" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">進捗状況</label>
            <select id="projInputStatus" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs bg-white font-medium">
              <option value="inquiry">相談・現地調査中</option>
              <option value="drawing">見積・図面作成中</option>
              <option value="contracted">契約済・石材手配中</option>
              <option value="carving">文字彫刻・工場加工中</option>
              <option value="construction">現地施工・基礎据付中</option>
              <option value="completed">完工・納骨引き渡し完了</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">契約・見積金額（円）</label>
            <input type="number" id="projInputContractAmount" placeholder="1700000" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">次の作業・アクション</label>
          <input type="text" id="projInputNextAction" placeholder="例: 11/5 基礎生コン打設、霊園養生計画書の提出" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
        </div>

        <!-- Google Drive リンク -->
        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 space-y-2">
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-700 text-xs flex items-center">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z"></path></svg>
            Google Driveリンクの登録
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
            <input type="url" id="projInputDriveDrawing" placeholder="図面フォルダのURL" class="border border-slate-300 rounded p-1.5 text-xs bg-white">
            <input type="url" id="projInputDriveEstimate" placeholder="見積書フォルダのURL" class="border border-slate-300 rounded p-1.5 text-xs bg-white">
            <input type="url" id="projInputDriveInvoice" placeholder="請求書フォルダのURL" class="border border-slate-300 rounded p-1.5 text-xs bg-white">
            <input type="url" id="projInputDrivePhotos" placeholder="現場写真フォルダのURL" class="border border-slate-300 rounded p-1.5 text-xs bg-white">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">特記事項・備考</label>
          <textarea id="projInputNote" rows="2" placeholder="お客様の要望、家紋、正面文字、法要日など" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex justify-end space-x-2 border-t">
          <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition">キャンセル</button>
          <button type="submit" class="px-5 py-2 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold rounded-lg shadow transition">保存する</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 5. 案件詳細・連携モーダル（関連タスク・入出金・履歴） -->
  <div id="modalProjectDetail" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 modal-backdrop">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-2xl w-full p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3">
        <div>
          <span id="detailProjStatusBadge" class="bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-bold">契約済</span>
          <h3 id="detailProjName" class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold text-slate-800 mt-1">佐藤家 墓所新規建立工事</h3>
        </div>
        <button class="modal-close-btn text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
        <!-- 基本情報グリッド -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2 bg-slate-50 p-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
          <div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">施主様</div>
            <div id="detailProjCustomer" class="font-bold text-slate-800">-</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">場所</div>
            <div id="detailProjLocation" class="font-bold text-slate-800">-</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">工期</div>
            <div id="detailProjSchedule" class="font-bold text-slate-800">-</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">契約金額</div>
            <div id="detailProjAmount" class="font-bold text-emerald-700">-</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Google Drive リンクボタン集 -->
        <div>
          <div class="font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1.5 flex items-center">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-blue-600 mr-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 7v10a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V9a2 2 0 00-2-2h-6l-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2z"></path></svg>
            Google Drive 資料
          </div>
          <div id="detailDriveLinks" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <!-- JSでボタン生成 -->
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ひもづく「今日の対応・タスク」 -->
        <div class="border-t pt-3">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>この案件の関連作業（タスク）</span>
          </h4>
          <div id="detailRelatedTasks" class="space-y-1.5">
            <!-- JS生成 -->
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ひもづく「入出金予定」 -->
        <div class="border-t pt-3">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-slate-800 mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>この案件の入金・支払予定</span>
          </h4>
          <div id="detailRelatedTx" class="space-y-1.5">
            <!-- JS生成 -->
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-3 border-t flex justify-end">
        <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn px-4 py-2 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 rounded-lg font-bold text-xs">閉じる</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 6. 弥生会計 専用記録モーダル -->
  <div id="modalYayoi" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 modal-backdrop">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
          <span class="text-xl">📊</span>
          <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800">弥生会計の入力進捗を記録</h3>
        </div>
        <button class="modal-close-btn text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <form id="formYayoi" class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">対象月 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
          <select id="yayoiInputMonth" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2.5 text-xs bg-white font-medium">
            <option value="2026年10月分">2026年10月分</option>
            <option value="2026年9月分" selected>2026年9月分</option>
            <option value="2026年8月分">2026年8月分</option>
            <option value="2026年7月分以前">2026年7月分以前</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">資料の種類 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="yayoiInputDocType" required placeholder="例: 銀行通帳コピー、カード明細、領収書綴り" value="銀行通帳・クレジットカード明細" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">今回完了した範囲 <span class="text-red-500">*</span></label>
          <input type="text" id="yayoiInputCompletedRange" required placeholder="例: 通帳出納帳の全額記帳完了、現金領収書の前半" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none">
        </div>

        <div>
          <label class="block font-bold text-slate-700 mb-1">残作業・夫への確認事項</label>
          <textarea id="yayoiInputRemaining" rows="2" placeholder="例: ホームセンター購入分の領収書1枚の勘定科目を夫に確認、東日本石材の請求書原本待ち" class="w-full border border-slate-300 rounded-lg p-2 text-xs focus:outline-none"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div class="pt-2 flex justify-end space-x-2 border-t">
          <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition">キャンセル</button>
          <button type="submit" class="px-5 py-2 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white font-bold rounded-lg shadow transition">作業履歴に記録</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 7. メール詳細 ＆ タスク化モーダル -->
  <div id="modalEmailDetail" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 modal-backdrop">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-lg w-full p-4 sm:p-6 shadow-2xl space-y-4 max-h-[90vh] overflow-y-auto">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-3">
        <div>
          <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400" id="modalMailSender">東日本石材</div>
          <h3 id="modalMailSubject" class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 mt-0.5">【納期回答】佐藤様邸 外柵材について</h3>
        </div>
        <button class="modal-close-btn text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-3 text-xs">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-slate-500">
          <span id="modalMailDate">受信: 2026-10-30 17:15</span>
          <span class="text-slate-300">|</span>
          <span id="modalMailDueDate" class="text-red-600 font-bold">期限: 2026-11-02</span>
          <span class="text-slate-300">|</span>
          <span id="modalMailAssignee">担当: 私</span>
        </div>

        <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 text-slate-700 whitespace-pre-wrap leading-relaxed text-xs" id="modalMailBody">
          <!-- メール本文 -->
        </div>

        <!-- ワンクリック タスク化エリア -->
        <div class="p-3 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-lg">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
            <span class="font-bold text-blue-900">このメールから作業（タスク）を登録</span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-blue-700">ホームのToDoに自動連携</span>
          </div>
          <button id="btnCreateTaskFromModalMail" class="w-full bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-bold py-2 rounded-lg text-xs shadow flex items-center justify-center space-x-1.5 transition">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2m-6 9l2 2 4-4"></path></svg>
            <span>ホームの「今日の対応」に登録する</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center justify-between pt-2">
          <a id="modalMailLink" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline flex items-center space-x-1">
            <span>Gmailで開く（ダミー）</span>
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </a>
          <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn px-4 py-2 border border-slate-300 rounded-lg text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-50 transition">閉じる</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 8. スマホ接続用 QRコード表示モーダル -->
  <div id="modalQr" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-3 sm:p-4 modal-backdrop">
    <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl max-w-sm w-full p-5 shadow-2xl text-center space-y-3">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b pb-2">
        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center">
          <span class="mr-1.5">📱</span> スマホから開く
        </h3>
        <button class="modal-close-btn text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-600 p-1">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600">
        Macと同じWi-Fiに接続したスマートフォンの<strong>カメラアプリで下のQRコードを読み取る</strong>と、すぐに開けます。
      </p>

      <div class="p-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl inline-block">
        <img id="qrCodeImg" src="https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=180x180&data=http://192.168.3.70:8080" alt="スマホ用QRコード" class="w-44 h-44 mx-auto rounded">
      </div>

      <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 bg-slate-100 p-2 rounded border border-slate-200">
        URL直接入力の場合:<br>
        <span id="qrCodeText" class="font-mono font-bold text-blue-700 select-all">http://192.168.3.71:8080</span>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-1">
        <button type="button" class="modal-close-btn w-full py-2 bg-slate-800 text-white font-bold text-xs rounded-lg hover:bg-slate-700 transition">閉じる</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Toast 通知コンテナ -->
  <div id="toastContainer" class="fixed top-14 right-4 z-50 space-y-2 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <!-- アプリケーションスクリプト -->
  <script src="js/store.js"></script>
  <script src="js/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
